From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:50:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] BlueOS: Settings: BlueOS easter egg

5 taps on the BlueOS version in About phone open a screen with the animated logo; taps send halos flying. Logo drawables come from vendor/blueos/tools/make-logo-assets.py.

Change-Id: I53b85d022aa7960269abf5e722a24c5ca34dd8b0
